+| `tests/recommend/test_routing_refresh.py` | `spec-panel-ponytail` added to `_POST_REFRESH_ADDITIONS` (no routing row) |
+
+No plugin mirror and no routing-guide row are added.
+
+## Install and the experiment Task
+
+Install next to the original, never over it: see `.dev/brainstorms/346-ponytail/INSTALL.md` for the copy commands, the sha256 lines to record and the rollback. `~/.claude/commands/sc/spec-panel.md` is never touched.
+
+```text
+/sc:spec-panel-ponytail @.dev/orca-command-refactor/specs/orca-worker-contract-spec.md --fix-audit --re-review .dev/orca-command-refactor/review/spec-panel-round2.md --baseline .dev/orca-command-refactor/specs/history/spec-v2-after-round1.md --dispositions .dev/orca-command-refactor/review/disposition-round2.md
+```
+
+After T09 the recorder runs `fix_audit.py verdict --dir .dev/orca-command-refactor/review/fix-audit --report .dev/orca-command-refactor/review/spec-panel-round3.md --report-rule any-severity` and reads the owner count from `final-verdict.md`.
